{"id":1319,"title":"Python 复杂数据类型 ","summary":"Python 复杂数据类型 ","tags":"","components":[{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"33981420-1378-3b71-b599-ea7c9551e450","title":"列表list","question_id":2918,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"question_id":2918,"title":"列表list","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"320f3eb5-c4ec-351b-8955-0936f04ab76f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"前一节我们回顾了Python中最基本的数字及字符串，但数字及字符串还不足以帮我们解决复杂的问题。<br>\n在真实的编程中其他4个数据类型**list（列表）、tuple（元组） 、set（集合）、 dictionary（字典）** 可谓是python中的大杀器，用好了，可以快速解决很多问题。\n\n接下来我们还是简单回顾下此四种复杂数据类型的基本知识，如果想要深入学习请移步我们出的[Python 入门课程](#/course/015/catalog)。\n\n\n###  列表格式 \nPython 列表是**任意对象**的**有序**集合，写在中括号`[]`里，元素之间用逗号`,`隔开。这里的**任意对象**，既可以是列表，也可以是字符串，如下所示:","text_html":"<p>前一节我们回顾了Python中最基本的数字及字符串，但数字及字符串还不足以帮我们解决复杂的问题。<br>\n在真实的编程中其他4个数据类型<strong>list（列表）、tuple（元组） 、set（集合）、 dictionary（字典）</strong> 可谓是python中的大杀器，用好了，可以快速解决很多问题。</p>\n<p>接下来我们还是简单回顾下此四种复杂数据类型的基本知识，如果想要深入学习请移步我们出的<a href=\"#/course/015/catalog\">Python 入门课程</a>。</p>\n<h3>列表格式</h3>\n<p>Python 列表是<strong>任意对象</strong>的<strong>有序</strong>集合，写在中括号<code>[]</code>里，元素之间用逗号<code>,</code>隔开。这里的<strong>任意对象</strong>，既可以是列表，也可以是字符串，如下所示:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"538fee37-d27b-3ca1-95f2-5eee6fbb9eb8","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"a_list = [1, 2, '12', [1, 2, '12']]\nprint(a_list)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{